  <div class="container trustbar__grid">
    <div class="trustbar__item">
      <span class="trustbar__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      <div><strong>Peroxide-free</strong><span>Whitening without the zing</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar__item">
      <span class="trustbar__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4c3 2 5 5 5 8a5 5 0 0 1-10 0c0-3 2-6 5-8Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      <div><strong>Enamel-safe</strong><span>Gentle on teeth &amp; gums</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar__item">
      <span class="trustbar__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20c5-1 8-5 8-11-4 0-7 1-8 4-1-3-4-4-8-4 0 6 3 10 8 11Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      <div><strong>Eco-friendly</strong><span>Biodegradable bamboo</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar__item">
      <span class="trustbar__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 7 10 17l-5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      <div><strong>30-day guarantee</strong><span>Love it or your money back</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Reviews -->
<section class="reviews" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--light">
      <span class="eyebrow">Loved by our community</span>
      <h2>Real smiles, real confidence</h2>
      <p class="reviews__rating"><span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> Rated 4.8/5 by happy customers</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reviews__grid">
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <blockquote>"Whiter teeth in under a week and zero sensitivity. I've tried the burning strips before &mdash; these are on another level."</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Sarah M.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <blockquote>"The charcoal toothpaste leaves my mouth feeling so clean and fresh. Coffee stains are finally fading."</blockquote>
        <figcaption>James T.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <blockquote>"Love that it's eco-friendly and it actually works. The bundle is such good value &mdash; my whole routine sorted."</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Am&eacute;lie R.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Mini FAQ -->
<section class="faq">
  <div class="container faq__inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details class="faq__item" open>
        <summary>How fast will I see results?</summary>
        <p>Most people notice a visibly brighter smile in as little as 7 days with the whitening strips, using them just 30 minutes a day. Results vary with your starting shade and habits like coffee, tea and wine.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Will it hurt or make my teeth sensitive?</summary>
        <p>Our strips are peroxide-free and designed to whiten with dramatically less of the zing and sensitivity that traditional strips cause. The toothpaste is a gentle, low-abrasion formula that won't strip your enamel.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Is LumySmile safe for enamel and gums?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Everything we make is enamel-safe and gum-friendly &mdash; it brightens without damaging or weakening your teeth. If you have specific dental concerns, we always recommend checking with your dentist first.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq__item">
        <summary>Where do you ship and how long does it take?</summary>
        <p>We offer fast tracked shipping across the US &amp; Canada, free on all orders. Orders are processed within 1&ndash;3 business days and typically arrive within 3&ndash;7 business days, with tracking emailed to you.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
    <p class="faq__more"><a class="link" href="/pages/faq">See all FAQs &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Newsletter -->
<section class="newsletter">
  <div class="container newsletter__inner">
    <div>
      <h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2>
      <p>Join the LumySmile list for smile tips, new drops and subscriber-only offers.</p>
    </div>
    {%- form 'customer', id: 'newsletterForm', class: 'newsletter__form' -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
      <label class="sr-only" for="newsletterEmail">Email address</label>
      <input type="email" id="newsletterEmail" name="contact[email]" placeholder="you@email.com" autocomplete="email" required>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Get my 10% off</button>
      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        <p class="newsletter__msg" id="newsletterMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite">You're in! Watch your inbox for your 10% off code.</p>
      {%- else -%}
        <p class="newsletter__msg" id="newsletterMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}
  </div>
</section>
